The cursor pictures in this folder are the Adwaita cursors by the GNOME
Project (https://www.gnome.org), from adwaita-cursors 51.0
(https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme), taken unchanged at
their 96-pixel size. They are not covered by kadr's MIT license.

